  {
    "id": "duel-splash-horizontal",
    "comment": "Combat scene start splash '/[UI]/MainUI/Layer_1/ReadyText/{Left,Right,Center}' (System/CombatStartText, was the joke 戰‧你‧娘‧親): three 50x500 TMP strips that stack the text one glyph per line. CombatUIManager.InitReadyText flies Left and Right (60pt) in with MovePanel.MoveToOrigin, hides them, then shows Center (100pt) and shakes it with DOShakeAnchorPos. English 'Duel Start' in a 50px-wide strip broke into a vertical column of letters. Make all three a 1000x160 horizontal box with no wrapping and auto-size 40-100 so the same fly-in and shake play with a single horizontal word pair; the anchors and anchored positions are untouched so the animation targets still line up.",
    "paths": [
      "/[UI]/MainUI/Layer_1/ReadyText/Center",
      "/[UI]/MainUI/Layer_1/ReadyText/Left",
      "/[UI]/MainUI/Layer_1/ReadyText/Right"
